<template><article class="container-shell py-20"><div class="article-prose mx-auto max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Last updated September 21, 2026</p><h2>Data we process</h2><p>Account use requires a name, email address, and securely hashed password. Link records include destinations and optional titles, descriptions, tags, and expiration dates.</p><h2>Click analytics</h2><p>Analytics may include time, referrer host, device category, browser, operating system, UTM values, and coarse country information. Raw IP addresses are not stored in the analytics database. A keyed daily hash is used for approximate unique counts.</p><h2>Retention</h2><p>Raw click-event retention is configurable and defaults to 90 days. Daily aggregate counts may be retained longer. Expired links are disabled rather than automatically deleted.</p><h2>Cookies</h2><p>The application uses a secure, HTTP-only session cookie for authentication. It does not require advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Users can edit or delete their links and revoke API tokens. Account deletion and jurisdiction-specific requests should be handled through the operator’s published support process.</p><h2>Deployment notice</h2><p>The operator must replace contact details, select a lawful basis, and adapt this policy to applicable law before offering the service publicly.</p></div></article></template>
